window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/c392-113990acf5e04e58.json"]={sha256:"113990acf5e04e580bada742f8f22bb726bd7d22c48a84883c54bc1cbf7d4600",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v24-case-b1a884169a2330fd","url":"https://www.nasa.gov/general/nasa-begins-new-deployable-solar-array-tech-demo-on-pathfinder-spacecraft/","title":"NASA Deployable Solar Array Technology Demonstration","titleEn":"NASA Deployable Solar Array Technology Demonstration","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c392","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"c392","related":[{"id":"c393","referenceUrls":["https://standards.nasa.gov/standard/NASA/NASA-STD-7002"],"title":"太空儀器熱真空試驗","titleEn":"Space-instrument thermal-vacuum testing","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學能量儲備需 0.025 J，增摩擦案例不足；另需全角度轉矩與鎖定證據，僅作無動力模型。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Teaching reserve is 0.025 J, unmet by higher friction; full-angle torque and latch evidence are additionally required, using an unpowered model only. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"估算熱平衡等待時間，區分箱壁達溫與試件達穩態。","differenceEn":"Estimate thermal settling time and distinguish chamber-wall temperature from article equilibrium.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學 k=0.04 N m/rad、初始變形 θ=π/2 rad、摩擦轉矩 0.01 N m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：E淨=0.5×0.04×(π/2)²−0.01×π/2。 結果約 0.0336401 J。彈簧可用能量 ½kθ²，固定摩擦耗能 τfθ；正餘能不保證每一角度都有正驅動轉矩。","以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學初溫 40°C、環境 −20°C、時間常數 1800 s，等待 3600 s。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：T=−20+60exp(−3600/1800)。 結果約 -11.8799 °C。集中熱容量模型 T=Tenv+(T0−Tenv)e^(−t/τ)；假設單一時間常數、固定環境及無自熱。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Teaching k=0.04 N m/rad, initial deflection θ=π/2 rad and friction torque 0.01 N m. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Enet=0.5×0.04×(π/2)²−0.01×π/2. Result ≈ 0.0336401 J. Spring energy is ½kθ² and constant-friction work is τfθ; positive net energy does not guarantee positive drive torque at every angle.","All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Teaching initial temperature is 40°C, environment −20°C, time constant 1800 s and wait 3600 s. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: T=−20+60exp(−3600/1800). Result ≈ -11.8799 °C. The lumped model T=Tenv+(T0−Tenv)e^(−t/τ) assumes one time constant, fixed surroundings and no self-heating.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"c302","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/mission/explorer-1/"],"title":"Explorer 1 科學衛星","titleEn":"Explorer 1 science satellite","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：教學能量儲備需 0.025 J，增摩擦案例不足；另需全角度轉矩與鎖定證據，僅作無動力模型。 每項結論須附輸入、單位、版本與未解限制。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Teaching reserve is 0.025 J, unmet by higher friction; full-angle torque and latch evidence are additionally required, using an unpowered model only. Attach inputs, units, revision and unresolved limitations to each conclusion.","difference":"建立計數器死時間模型，避免把高通量下的計數不足誤認為沒有粒子。","differenceEn":"Model detector dead time so undercounting at high flux is not mistaken for an absence of particles.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下皆為教學假設，非實際任務參數。教學 k=0.04 N m/rad、初始變形 θ=π/2 rad、摩擦轉矩 0.01 N m。 先按量綱手算，再以試算表獨立列式。教學名義算例：E淨=0.5×0.04×(π/2)²−0.01×π/2。 結果約 0.0336401 J。彈簧可用能量 ½kθ²，固定摩擦耗能 τfθ；正餘能不保證每一角度都有正驅動轉矩。","從 m=n/(1+nτ) 代數求 n，列 m=0、400、800 s⁻¹ 的修正值。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["All values are teaching assumptions, not mission specifications. Teaching k=0.04 N m/rad, initial deflection θ=π/2 rad and friction torque 0.01 N m. Calculate by hand with units, then independently formulate a worksheet. Synthetic nominal case: Enet=0.5×0.04×(π/2)²−0.01×π/2. Result ≈ 0.0336401 J. Spring energy is ½kθ² and constant-friction work is τfθ; positive net energy does not guarantee positive drive torque at every angle.","Invert m=n/(1+nτ) and tabulate corrections at m=0,400,800 s⁻¹.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v24-case-553f6d117b6ee67e","url":"https://standards.nasa.gov/standard/NASA/NASA-STD-7002","title":"NASA-STD-7002 Payload Test Requirements","titleEn":"NASA-STD-7002 Payload Test Requirements","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v24-case-4549029668f3c816","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/mission/explorer-1/","title":"Explorer 1 science satellite — official mission background","titleEn":"Explorer 1 science satellite — official mission background","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
